---
// Cross-site mode toggle. Mirrors the segmented control on jaredgase.com so the
// two sites read as one product. On the deck, "Presentation" is the active
// (highlighted) segment; "Normal" links back to the main site.
//
// Rendered from Base.astro on every route, so it persists across the whole
// deck domain. Styles live in global.css (not scoped here) so the active-pill
// brand blue can't go stale. The deck has no client router / view transitions,
// so no transition:persist is needed — it simply re-renders identically.
---
<div class="mode-fab" role="group" aria-label="View mode">
  <a class="mode-seg" href="https://jaredgase.com">Normal</a>
  <span class="mode-seg active" aria-current="true">Presentation</span>
</div>
